                            {
                                "example_id": "02c65bfd-1269-4238-9b66-6df08b5d2f2f",
                                "sense_id": "554df370-143a-36e1-ab12-c6e626ed27b5",
                                "text": "He aroſe and went on / and beholde a man off ethiopia which was gelded / and of grete auctoꝛite with Candace qune of the ethiopians / which had the rule off all her treaſure / cam to Ieruſalem foꝛ to pꝛaye."
                            },
